&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2486&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d6312d22-3a41-4bcc-837e-9eee49ca8fda&quot;&gt;Experience leading teams through significant changes in ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
