&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;Senior Account Manager (3 Month FTC)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW263172032 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263172032 BCX8&quot;&gt;Remote working with 1-2 days in Slough onsite with clients&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Senior Account Manager, you&#39;re the primary client partner for Client — building relationships that go beyond day-to-day delivery to become a genuine strategic voice within their business. Within a studio of 20–30 dedicated agency professionals, with 1–3 direct reports, you&#39;ll be accountable for account health, commercial performance, and the quality of every client interaction. Reporting to the Brand Partner, you&#39;ll work closely with Project Managers to keep delivery on track and clients engaged. You&#39;ll also play an active role in identifying new business opportunities — introducing OLIVER and Inside Ideas Group capabilities where they add real value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the client relationship with Client across all levels of the organisation, acting as a trusted advisor and strategic digital partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take accountability for the commercial health of the account — profitability, forecasting accuracy, fee negotiation, and regular financial reporting to the Brand Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee project delivery, run rates, and client satisfaction through structured WIPs and proactive account management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the escalation point for gaps in client or internal SLAs — capturing issues, proposing solutions, and working with the Brand Partner, Business Director, and Head of Operations to resolve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and develop new business opportunities within the account, connecting the right OLIVER capabilities to the right client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate clear, fair outcomes with clients on behalf of your team — balancing expectations, capacity, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach, and develop 1–3 direct reports, creating the conditions for strong performance and professional growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Project Managers to ensure every project is delivered on time, on brief, and to the highest standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project-level and account-level budgets, including cost estimation, purchase orders, invoicing, and reconciliation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and negotiate with freelancers and production partners where required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce regular, accurate financial reports for the Brand Partner and Business Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and flag budget risks early, with clear recommendations for mitigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you need to be great in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven account management experience within a creative, digital, or integrated agency — ideally with exposure to embedded or in-house studio models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client relationship skills, with confidence engaging at senior client levels and building long-term partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial acumen: experience managing budgets, forecasting, fee negotiation, and identifying revenue growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinking across digital, social, creative, data, and production — with the ability to contribute ideas and challenge briefs constructively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including confident presentation and stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and developing junior team members, with a collaborative and supportive leadership style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how to integrate effectively with a client-side team while maintaining high agency standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with FMCG brands or consumer goods markets is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Office and relevant workflow or project management platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing project-level and account-level budgets, including cost estimation, supplier negotiation, and financial reconciliation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence presenting financial performance to senior stakeholders and proactively flagging risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced use of Gen AI tools to enhance account management, client communications, and team workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and refining AI-assisted processes for yourself and the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to train others on effective Gen AI use within an account management context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic approach to complex, multi-step client challenges — able to break down ambiguity and drive clear paths forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound understanding of AI capabilities and limitations, with consistent human oversight applied to all outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Req ID:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt; 18801&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-CK1 #LI-MidSenior #LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our values shape everything we do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
